    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[DadaProgressions Beta 26.2]]></title>
        <id>https://andreadada.github.io/dadadocu/dadaprogressions-changelog/beta-26.2</id>
        <link href="https://andreadada.github.io/dadadocu/dadaprogressions-changelog/beta-26.2"/>
        <updated>2026-07-04T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
        <summary type="html"><![CDATA[Beta 26.2 makes complex goals easier to edit and debug.]]></summary>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Beta 26.2 makes complex goals easier to edit and debug.</p>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="filters">Filters<a href="https://andreadada.github.io/dadadocu/dadaprogressions-changelog/beta-26.2#filters" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Filters" title="Direct link to Filters">​</a></h2>
<p>Filter groups now support <code>filter-mode: ALL</code> and <code>filter-mode: ANY</code>, both on the goal and on individual criteria.</p>
<p>New filters:</p>
<ul>
<li><code>biome</code></li>
<li><code>min-y</code> / <code>max-y</code></li>
<li><code>min-amount</code> / <code>max-amount</code></li>
</ul>
<p><code>include</code> is the allow-list and <code>exclude</code> is the veto-list. If the same value appears in both, <code>exclude</code> wins.</p>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="editor">Editor<a href="https://andreadada.github.io/dadadocu/dadaprogressions-changelog/beta-26.2#editor" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Editor" title="Direct link to Editor">​</a></h2>
<p><code>/dp admin editor</code> can now manage goals, composite criteria, filters and prerequisites. Numeric values use a keypad; known values such as materials, entities and worlds use paginated selectors.</p>
<p>Changes are validated before they are kept. If something is invalid, the previous file and active configuration are restored.</p>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="debug-and-validation">Debug and validation<a href="https://andreadada.github.io/dadadocu/dadaprogressions-changelog/beta-26.2#debug-and-validation" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Debug and validation" title="Direct link to Debug and validation">​</a></h2>
<p>Use this command before performing an action with the selected player:</p>
<div class="language-text codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_QJqH"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-text codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><span class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token plain">/dp admin debug &lt;goalId&gt; &lt;onlinePlayer&gt;</span><br></span></code></pre></div></div>
<p>It shows the real event values, filter results, points, prerequisites and cooldown.</p>
<p><code>/dp admin validate</code> checks the files without loading them. <code>/dp admin reload</code> now keeps the previous working goals if a new file is broken.</p>]]></content>
