    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[DadaProgressions Beta 26.1]]></title>
        <id>https://andreadada.github.io/dadadocu/dadaprogressions-changelog/beta-26.1</id>
        <link href="https://andreadada.github.io/dadadocu/dadaprogressions-changelog/beta-26.1"/>
        <updated>2026-07-01T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
        <summary type="html"><![CDATA[Beta 26.1 adds modular goals and cleans up notifications.]]></summary>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Beta 26.1 adds modular goals and cleans up notifications.</p>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="goals">Goals<a href="https://andreadada.github.io/dadadocu/dadaprogressions-changelog/beta-26.1#goals" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Goals" title="Direct link to Goals">​</a></h2>
<ul>
<li>Goals can contain several criteria joined with <code>AND</code> or <code>OR</code>.</li>
<li>Each criterion keeps its own progress.</li>
<li>Added filters for materials, entities, worlds, game modes, permissions, commands, damage causes and attribution.</li>
<li>Point rules can assign fixed values or multipliers.</li>
<li>Goals can require another goal to be completed, either in the current period or at any time in the past.</li>
<li>Animal breeding is now tracked automatically, including on older server versions.</li>
</ul>
<p>The default files include a few community goals that use the new system. Existing simple goals still work as before.</p>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="notifications">Notifications<a href="https://andreadada.github.io/dadadocu/dadaprogressions-changelog/beta-26.1#notifications" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Notifications" title="Direct link to Notifications">​</a></h2>
<p>Chat, action bar, title and boss bar now have separate queues. Repeated updates are grouped instead of sending a message for every single action.</p>
<p>Chat can also combine updates from different goals into one line. Timing, queue size and channel limits remain configurable.</p>
<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="gui">GUI<a href="https://andreadada.github.io/dadadocu/dadaprogressions-changelog/beta-26.1#gui" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to GUI" title="Direct link to GUI">​</a></h2>
<p>Goal entries now show the actual objective and useful progress values. The longer technical state text is hidden by default and can be restored with <code>gui.list.goal-item.show-state-lore</code>.</p>]]></content>
